## SECTION 7: QUALITY CHECKLIST

- [ ] Every orchestration shape documented (count verified per `.odx`)
- [ ] Every map link documented (count verified per map), `.btm`+`.xsl` both consulted
- [ ] Every schema field tree documented
- [ ] Every `.cs` helper referenced by an orchestration documented OR flagged 🔴 GAP
- [ ] Every artifact has a replication verdict (🟢/🟡/🔴)
- [ ] All 🟡/🔴 captured in `replication-gap-report.md` with reasons + actions
- [ ] Every claim cites a source file (+ OID/LinkID where available)
- [ ] UTF-16 files read correctly (no garbled text)
- [ ] Encrypted/env values marked `[ENCRYPTED]`/`[ENV]`, never guessed
- [ ] One Mermaid flow per orchestration; passes render self-check
- [ ] **Conciseness benchmarked against the canonical example `examples/01_oracle_changepo/`** — complete, not padded
- [ ] **Structure matches the canonical example EXACTLY** — header, section order, locked table columns (per `templates/documentation-style.yaml`)
- [ ] **Every cross-doc reference uses the blockquote + icon format** (📦 🔀 🗂️ 🔗 🧩 🚧 📋)
- [ ] Certification reconciles documented counts against Phase 0 inventory

